# 🧠 AI Disease Prediction System

An AI-powered healthcare prediction system that predicts possible diseases based on user-reported symptoms using Machine Learning.

## 🚀 Features
- Predicts diseases based on multiple symptoms
- Uses a Machine Learning model (Decision Tree Classifier)
- Interactive web interface built with Streamlit
- Displays prediction confidence level
- Clean and simple UI

## 🩺 Symptoms Used
- Fever
- Cough
- Fatigue
- Headache
- Sore Throat
- Nausea
- Body Pain
- Runny Nose

## 🧪 Diseases Predicted
- Flu
- Cold
- Migraine
- Food Poisoning
- COVID

## 🛠 Technologies Used
- Python
- Scikit-learn
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Streamlit

